            "value": "Ceferino, L., Kiremidjian, A. & Deierlein, G. (2018). Regional Multi-severity Casualty Estimation Due to Building Damage Following a Mw 8.8 Earthquake Scenario in Lima, Peru. Earthquake Spectra. https://doi.org/10.1193/080617EQS154M\n",
            "type": "citation/reference",
            "identifier": [],
            "displayLabel": "Related Publication",
